@startuml
title BridgeIT - Requirement Lifecycle

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Submitted : submit()

Submitted --> Analyzed : analyse /\nmark_analyzed()

Analyzed --> Validated : approve /\nvalidate()
Analyzed --> Clarified : edit /\nclarify(new_text)
Analyzed --> Rejected : reject()

Clarified --> Analyzed : re-analyse /\nmark_analyzed()

Validated --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]

note right of Clarified
The same Requirement identifier
is preserved while the current
RequirementText is replaced.

A clarified requirement must
be analysed again before another
human validation decision.
end note

note right of Analyzed
AI analysis may produce a quality
indication, but it cannot produce
Validated or Rejected autonomously.
end note

@enduml
